{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52155","headline":"四言曲池酺饮座铭 · 许敬宗","name":"四言曲池酺饮座铭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日月扬彩，爟烽撤候。\n赐饮平郊，列筵春岫。\n露鲜芳薄，影华清溜。\n倒载言旋，骊歌貮奏。\n（同前）（按：本诗原署：「给事中高阳县开国男臣许敬宗上。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52155.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52155","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}